Sval: Remove about:logins

about:logins was unregistered, and the sidebar's password list it shares
fields with was locked off with the password manager (Sval spec §7.3).
Both go, with breach alerts on saved passwords, the about:protections
actor that read them, password export and every way left that opened
the page: Page Info's Passwords row, the toolbar button, the app menu
item and the address bar's quick action. Their prefs, strings, tests and
tooling entries go too.

